  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for mbedtls-2",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for mbedtls-2 fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in mbedtls-2:\n\n- CVE-2025-52496: race condition in AESNI support detection, AES key\n  disclosure / GCM forgery in multithreaded programs (boo#1245810)\n- CVE-2025-59438: padding oracle through timing of cipher error\n  reporting (boo#1252454)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
